      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "content": "### 🛠️ Observability Control Panel\n\nThis dashboard consolidates system observability:\n\n*   **Logs:** The Loki panel on the left shows real-time logs. Clicking on any log containing a `trace_id` will display a link to jump directly into **Jaeger** to inspect the trace!\n*   **Traces:** Open [Jaeger UI](http://localhost:16686) to search and visualize gRPC and HTTP distributed traces.\n*   **Errors (Sentry/GlitchTip):** Open [GlitchTip Console](http://localhost:8075) to view tracked exceptions, errors, stack traces, and release health metrics for the backend and frontend services.\n"
      },
      "title": "Diagnostics & Quick Links",
      "type": "markdown"
    }
